error[type-mismatch] 7:13-7:28
           (+ (get cur :size) 1)))
              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  This is an Option<Int>, but an Int is needed here.
  Expected: Int
  Found: Option<Int>
  The records that reach this point do not all have :size: the record at 6:20 has none.
  Sx does not narrow a field by a flag such as :known, so testing a flag does not make :size present.
  Match on it, or give get a default: (get cur :size DEFAULT).
  Fix: (match (get cur :size) (some size) ... none ...)
